msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:124
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where premade themes were hidden when custom themes were "
"disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:125
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where importing files with Japanese dakuten/handakuten "
"characters (e.g., ガ, パ, べ) failed on macOS due to Unicode normalization "
"mismatch (NFC/NFD)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:126
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused profile pictures to be incorrectly rotated on "
"upload, as their EXIF rotation tag was ignored (reported on iOS)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:127
msgid ""
"Fixed a nil pointer dereference in ``UpdateUser`` when the user update "
"operation returned an unexpected nil result (Sentry VF, 14 events)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:128
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with the date picker not being able to overflow "
"interactive dialogs properly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:129
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where fetching a newly created channel could fail with "
"\"channel not found\" on deployments with database read replicas."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:130
msgid ""
"Fixed visual glitches with misaligned text and icon in image attachments "
"in compact mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:131
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where shared channels would intermittently display "
"\"Shared with trusted organizations\" instead of showing the actual "
"connection name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:132
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where attachment-only posts would get sent on **enter** "
"even when set to only send on **ctrl/cmd + enter**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:133
msgid ""
"Fixed styling issues in the **Browse Channels** modal when there were "
"long channel purpose values present."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:134
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where shared channel invites were silently dropped in High"
" Availability clusters when the API request landed on a non-leader node."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:135
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where message attachment titles would render encoded "
"special characters as-is."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:136
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with the **Invite to Team** modal ignoring the most recent"
" key pressed when suggesting users (reported on Desktop App and web "
"browser)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:137
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a \"Don't have an account\" link showed up on the "
"login page even when signups were disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:138
msgid ""
"Fixed issues with interactive dialogs - dynamic select lookups, radio "
"values, and field refresh."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:139
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where desktop notifications still triggered for a channel "
"or thread that was focused in a popout window (reported on Desktop App)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:140
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the ``remote_id`` field on user objects could be set"
" via the user patch API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:141
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where keyboard navigation didn't work in the channel "
"header and sidebar channel menus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:142
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Workspace Optimization page appeared in the "
"System Console on Mattermost Cloud workspaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:143
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where in compact mode, file attachment's name didn't "
"display correctly when editing a post with attachments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:144
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the textbox would appear focused but not accept "
"keyboard shortcuts after editing a post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:145
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where SAML login failed for users mapped via objectGUID "
"when the IdP sent the value as a UUID string instead of base64-encoded "
"raw bytes (affecting Keycloak 26.6.0 and later with user-attribute-ldap-"
"mapper)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:146
msgid "Fixed an issue with clipped emoticons and letters in channel banners."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:147
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where removing a remote could leave channels in a "
"\"shared\" state, even if not shared with any remote."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:148
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where OpenSearch/Elasticsearch reindex jobs could report "
"success even when bulk writes were silently rejected by the search "
"backend, causing silent data loss in the search index."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:150
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:310
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:569
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:693
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:817
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:917
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1060
msgid "API Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:151
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Added a new API endpoint ``GET "
"/api/v4/channels/{channel_id}/views/{view_id}/posts`` to retrieve "
"paginated posts for a specific view. Card posts are temporarily excluded "
"from search results. Card posts now use collaborative permissions — any "
"channel member can edit or delete any card without needing "
"``edit_others_posts/delete_others_posts`` permissions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:152
msgid "Added new API endpoints for the Property System Architecture v2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:153
msgid ""
"Plugin API: Added new pre-hooks for channel membership, team membership, "
"and channel archiving. Plugins can now intercept operations before they "
"are persisted using three new hooks: ``ChannelMemberWillBeAdded`` (modify"
" or reject a channel member addition), ``TeamMemberWillBeAdded`` (modify "
"or reject a team member addition), and ``ChannelWillBeArchived`` (reject "
"a channel archive)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:154
msgid ""
"Added new API endpoints ``PUT /api/v4/system/e2e/ai_bridge``, ``GET "
"/api/v4/system/e2e/ai_bridge``, and ``DELETE "
"/api/v4/system/e2e/ai_bridge`` for E2E testing of AI features. These "
"endpoints are only accessible when ``EnableTesting`` is true. Refactored "
"internal AI-related logic to use a new ``AgentsBridge`` interface for "
"improved testability. Added new DTOs in ``server/public/model`` for AI "
"bridge information and test helpers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:155
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Added a new API endpoint ``PUT /api/v4/channels/{channel_id}/members`` "
"that sets the complete membership of a channel in a single call. The "
"endpoint accepts [a JSON object](https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/administration-guide/comply/embedded-json-audit-log-schema.html) with "
"``members`` (desired user IDs) and an optional ``channel_admins`` (user "
"IDs to designate as channel admins). The server computes the diff against"
" current membership, adds or removes users as needed, and reconciles "
"admin roles. Results are streamed back as NDJSON for progress tracking. "
"Requires system admin permissions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:156
msgid ""
"Added three new plugin APIs for shared channel sync: "
"``ReceiveSharedChannelSyncMsg``, "
"``ReceiveSharedChannelAttachmentSyncMsg``, and "
"``ReceiveSharedChannelProfileImageSyncMsg``. These allow plugins acting "
"as shared channel remotes to sync posts, reactions, users, file "
"attachments, and profile images into Mattermost, complementing the "
"existing outbound ``OnSharedChannels`` hooks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:158
msgid "Websocket Event Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:159
msgid "Added websocket events for Property System Architecture v2."
msgstr ""

