msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:162
msgid ""
"Added new audit logs ``AuditEventCreateView``, ``AuditEventGetView``, "
"``AuditEventUpdateView``, ``AuditEventDeleteView``, "
"``AuditEventListViewsForChannel``, ``AuditEventUpdateViewSortOrder``, "
"``AuditEventGetPostsForView``, ``AuditEventCreatePropertyField``, "
"``AuditEventDeletePropertyField``, ``AuditEventGetPropertyFields``, "
"``AuditEventPatchPropertyField``, ``AuditEventGetPropertyValues``, and "
"``AuditEventPatchPropertyValues`` for Integrated Boards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:163
msgid ""
"Added a new audit log ``AuditEventSetChannelMembers`` for channel "
"memberships."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:164
msgid ""
"Added new audit logs ``AuditEventCreateTeamAccessPolicy``, "
