msgid ""
"Added support for Default Agent in suggestions and integrated Agents into"
" the App Bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:239
msgid ""
"Improved the reliability of AI recap summarization by using structured "
"JSON output from the LLM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:240
msgid ""
"Added a new feature of creating teams and channels using [anonymous "
"URLs](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide/collaborate/rename-"
"channels.html) so the channel and team name are not revealed in the URL. "
"Requires Enterprise Advanced license."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:241
msgid ""
"Added [popouts](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/search-for-messages.html#search-for-message) for Recent Mentions, Saved "
"Messages, and Search Results via the right-hand side."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:242
msgid ""
"The emoji picker on web and Desktop now inserts unicode emoji characters "
"into the message composer instead of shortcode text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:243
msgid "Renamed Enterprise Advanced feature Content Flagging to Data Spillage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:244
msgid ""
"Added [a contextual note](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-"
"guide/onboard/sso-google.html#step-3-configure-mattermost-for-google-"
"apps-sso) in Security Settings that explains how Google SSO can "
"synchronize usernames and emails, shown alongside the Sign-in Method "
"details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:245
msgid ""
"Renamed ``SlackAttachment`` and ``SlackAttachmentField`` types to "
"``MessageAttachment`` and ``MessageAttachmentField``. Old names are "
"maintained as deprecated aliases for backward compatibility with plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:246
msgid ""
"Posts created by integrations using Slack-compatible attachments "
"(webhooks, bots, plugins) are now fully searchable in Elasticsearch. "
"Previously, only the attachment text field was indexed. Now title, "
"pretext, fallback, and field content are also indexed. A bulk re-index is"
" required after upgrade to apply this to existing posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:247
msgid ""
"Added timezone support and manual time entry for Interactive Dialog "
"``datetime`` fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:248
msgid ""
"Added sub-day relative date patterns (H/M/S) for datetime dialog fields, "
"enabling min/max constraints with hour, minute, and second precision."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:251
msgid ""
"Added \"Guests in single channel\" and \"Guests in multiple channels\" "
"[role filters](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard"
"/guest-accounts.html) and a \"Channel count\" column to the System "
"Console Users report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:252
msgid ""
"Added reporting and soft-limit tracking for single-channel guests. "
"Single-channel guests are no longer counted toward the primary licensed "
"seat count and are permitted free up to a 1:1 ratio with licensed seats. "
"A new stat card, license row, and admin banner provide visibility into "
"single-channel guest usage and overage warnings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:253
msgid ""
"Introduced authentication token generation for Hosted Push Notification "
"Service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:254
msgid ""
"Users assigned the Shared Channel Manager role can now share and unshare "
"channels and browse available connections without needing the Secure "
"Connection Manager role."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:255
msgid ""
"System Admins are now allowed [to view and "
"update](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/configure/user-"
"management-configuration-settings.html#users) User **AuthData** and "
"**Username** in the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:256
msgid ""
"Added single-channel guest count to the support packet stats for improved"
" licensing visibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:259
msgid ""
"Added Prometheus metrics support for plugin webapp performance "
"measurements, enabling monitoring and load testing of plugin client-side "
"operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:260
msgid ""
"Data spillage reports are now cached in the Redux store to reduce "
"unnecessary API calls and to improve performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:263
msgid ""
"Added support for using CJK analysis plugins if installed for "
"Elasticsearch (also Opensearch) to improve search results for Korean, "
"Japanese and Chinese languages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:264
