"side panel in a pop-out window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:265
msgid ""
"Plugins can now display times in specific timezones and allow text input "
"for exact times."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:268
