msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:297
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where popouts changing state did not update the title on "
"Desktop App."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:298
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with angle brackets displaying as HTML entities in inline "
"code blocks within dialog markdown text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:299
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:364
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:491
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where image proxies did not detect content-types "
"accurately in certain cases."
