#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:300
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:365
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:492
msgid "Fixed an issue with edit post permissions."
