#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:302
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:368
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:495
msgid "Fixed an issue with custom slash command response URL construction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:303
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with [file attachment "
"processing](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/search-for-messages.html#search-for-files) for certain archive types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:304
msgid ""
"Fixed a server-side validation that was incorrectly rejecting valid "
"datetime and relative patterns in ``MinDate``/``MaxDate`` fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:305
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with the PostgreSQL query parameter overflow and added "
"transactional atomicity for bulk inserts of channel members, team "
"members, thread memberships, posts, statuses, and group members."
