#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:306
msgid "Fixed an issue with source language detection for auto-translations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:307
msgid ""
"Fixed typing issues in the **Find Channels** modal caused by interference"
