msgid ""
"Added [debug logs](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-"
"guide/manage/logging.html#cluster-job-execution-debug-messages) to "
"indicate if the scheduled post job, Do Not Disturb status reset job, or "
"the post reminder job is not running with the current node not being a "
"leader node."
msgstr ""

