msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:635
msgid ""
"Under ``ServiceSettings`` in ``config.json``, added "
"``AWSMeteringTimeoutSeconds``.  This configuration value can be used to "
"set the timeout in seconds when connecting to the AWS marketplace "
"metering service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:636
msgid ""
"Under ``NativeAppSettings`` in ``config.json``, added "
"``EnableIntuneMAM``, which can be edited in the **System Console**."
