"Sidebar (RHS) component using ``registerRightHandSidebarComponent`` will "
"need to implement additional code to support RHS popouts if their RHS "
"component relies on plugin-specific state. See [this forum "
"post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/rhs-popout-support-for-"
"plugins/25626) for full details."
