msgid "Reduced the channel banner height."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:782
msgid ""
"Improved license and plan name clarity throughout the user interface. "
"License settings and the **About** modal now display specific plan names "
"(Professional, Enterprise, Entry) instead of the generic \"Enterprise "
"Edition\" label, reducing confusion between edition and plan terminology."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:785
msgid "Added search backend type to the Support Packet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:786
msgid "Added SAML provider type to the Support Packet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:788
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:903
msgid "Integrations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:789
msgid ""
"Permission schemes now fully expose controls for managing other users' "
"integrations (Webhooks, Slash Commands, OAuth Apps) in the **System "
"Console** for greater administrative clarity. Additionally, permissions "
"for managing your own integrations have been renamed for consistency, and"
" a new configuration option allows administrators to enforce Incoming "
"Webhook channel locking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:790
msgid "Added AI-enabled rewriting of messages for servers with the Agents plugin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:791
msgid "Applicable posts are now marked as AI-generated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:792
msgid ""
"Added an authorization metadata endpoint and [Dynamic Client Registration"
" of Confidential OAuth Apps](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-"
"guide/configure/integrations-configuration-settings.html#enable-dynamic-"
"client-registration)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:793
msgid ""
"Added OAuth public client support through DCR and PKCE for "
"public/confidential clients."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:794
msgid "Added support for a resource parameter with OAuth."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:795
msgid ""
"Added ability to create OAuth public clients through the **Integrations**"
" page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:796
msgid "Added ``http.Flusher`` support to the plugin RPC layer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:799
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Benchmarking test results showed no significant difference: a 2.62% "
"decrease in the number of supported users for the new release, which lies"
" within the ``[-5%, +5%]`` prediction interval. View the full raw data "
"and methodology in our [Performance Reports "
"repository](https://github.com/mattermost/performance-reports/tree/main"
"/performance-comparisons/v11.2)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:802
msgid ""
"Fixed a server panic that could occur when patching channel moderations "
"with restricted permissions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:803
msgid "Fixed the justification of sidebar icons for plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:804
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with the translation of \"Until <time>\" text for custom "
"statuses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:805
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where guest users could not log in via SAML when \"Ignore "
"Guest Users when Synchronizing with AD/LDAP\" was enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:806
msgid "Fixed an issue where length validation was missing for LDAP user fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:807
msgid "Fixed an issue where some modals would appear when editing messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:808
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the slash command autocomplete did not preserve user"
" input case when forwarding pretext to backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:809
msgid "Fixed an issue where some text on the signup page was not translatable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:810
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:853
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where thread popouts did not show the current user's "
"status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:811
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:854
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where clicking on a permalink to a reply in another thread"
" would not navigate the main window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:812
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where focusing on the thread popout would not mark the "
"thread as read."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:813
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a content reviewer could not download file "
"attachments from a flagged post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:814
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:855
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where users could not add bots without an error message "
"popping up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:815
msgid "Fixed an issue displaying custom emojis in thread popouts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:818
msgid ""
"Added a new ``api/v4/posts/rewrite`` endpoint to enable AI-powered "
"message rewriting. It accepts a message, an AI agent ID, and a rewrite "
"action, and returns a JSON object with a ``rewritten_text`` field "
"containing the rewritten text. The endpoint supports six predefined "
"actions: ``shorten``, ``elaborate``, ``improve_writing``, "
"``fix_spelling``, ``simplify``, and ``summarize``. A custom action is "
"also available, which requires a ``custom_prompt`` parameter to specify "
"the desired transformation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:819
msgid ""
"Updated the ``GetFile``  ``GET`` ``api/v4/files/file_id`` endpoint to "
"include two new query params: ``as_content_reviewer`` and "
"``flagged_post_id``. These are used for the Data Spillage feature to "
"allow content reviewers to download files from flagged posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:820
msgid ""
"Added two new fields to the ``/oauth/authorize`` endpoints called "
"``code_challenge`` and ``code_challenge_method`` in order to support PKCE"
" with our OAuth authorization flow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:821
msgid ""
"Added ``/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server`` so that OAuth clients "
"can check what Mattermost supports. The endpoint returns a 501 error if "
"``ServiceSettings.EnableOAuthServiceProvider`` is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:822
msgid ""
"Added ``/api/v4/oauth/apps/register`` in order to support Dynamic Client "
"Registration for OAuth. This allows **any** external OAuth client to "
"automatically register an OAuth App within Mattermost without requiring "
"authentication. The endpoint requires "
"``ServiceSettings.EnableOAuthServiceProvider`` and "
"``ServiceSettings.EnableDynamicClientRegistration`` to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:823
msgid ""
"Introduced ``GET /api/v4/agents`` and ``GET /api/v4/llmservices`` to "
"allow authenticated clients to fetch available agents and LLM services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:826
msgid "Added new ``AuditEventRegisterOAuthClient``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:829
msgid "v11.2 is built with Go ``v1.24.6``."
msgstr ""

