msgid "**11.0.2, released 2025-10-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:964
msgid ""
"Reverted a breaking change related to "
"``ServiceSettings.ExperimentalStrictCSRFEnforcement`` setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:965
msgid "**11.0.1, released 2025-10-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:966
msgid "Original 11.0.1 release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:970
msgid ""
"GitLab SSO has been deprecated from Team Edition. Deployments using "
"GitLab SSO can remain on v10.11 ESR (with 12 months of security updates),"
" transition to our new free offering Mattermost Entry, or can explore "
"commercial/nonprofit options. See more details in [this forum "
"post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/mattermost-v11-changes-in-free-"
"offerings/25126)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:971
msgid ""
"The ``TeamSettings.ExperimentalViewArchivedChannels`` setting has been "
"deprecated. Archived channels will always be accessible, subject to "
"normal channel membership. The server will fail to start if this setting "
"is set to ``false``. To deny access to archived channels, mark them as "
"private and remove affected channel members. See more details in [this "
"forum post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/viewing-accessing-archived-"
"channels-v11/22626)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:972
msgid ""
"Playbooks has been deprecated from Team Edition. Entry, Professional, "
"Enterprise, and Enterprise Advanced plans are automatically upgraded to "
"Playbooks v2 with no expected downtime. See more details in [this forum "
"post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/clarification-and-update-on-the-"
"playbooks-plugin-v11/25192)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:973
msgid ""
"Experimental Bleve Search functionality has been retired. If Bleve is "
"enabled, search will not work until ``DisableDatabaseSearch`` is set to "
"``false``. See more details in [this forum "
"post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/transitioning-from-bleve-search-in-"
"mattermost-v11/22982)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:974
msgid ""
"Support for MySQL has ended. Our [Migration "
"Guide](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/postgres-"
"migration.html) outlines the steps, tools and support available for "
"migrating to PostgreSQL. See more details in [this forum "
"post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/transition-to-postgresql/19551)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:975
msgid ""
"The ``registerPostDropdownMenuComponent`` hook in the web app’s plugin "
"API has been removed in favour of ``registerPostDropdownMenuAction``. See"
" more details in [this forum "
"post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/deprecating-a-post-dropdown-menu-"
"component-plugin-api-v11/25001)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:976
msgid ""
"The web app is no longer exposing the [Styled Components](https://styled-"
"components.com/) dependency for use by web app plugins. See more details "
"in [this forum post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/removing-styled-"
"components-export-for-web-app-plugins-v11/25002)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:977
msgid ""
"Omnibus support has been deprecated. The last ``mattermost-omnibus`` "
"release was v10.12. See more details in [this forum "
"post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/mattermost-omnibus-to-reach-end-of-"
"life-v11/25175)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:978
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``include_removed_members`` option in ``api/v4/ldap/sync`` has"
" been removed. Admins can use the LDAP setting ``ReAddRemovedMembers``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:979
msgid ""
"Customers that have the NPS plugin enabled can remove it as it no longer "
"sends the feedback over through telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:980
msgid ""
"Format query parameter requirement in the ``/api/v4/config/client`` "
"endpoint has been deprecated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:981
msgid "Removed deprecated mmctl commands and flags:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:982
msgid "``channel add`` - use ``channel users add``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:983
msgid "``channel remove`` - use ``channel users remove``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:984
msgid "``channel restore`` - use ``channel unarchive``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:985
msgid "``channel make-private`` - use ``channel modify --private``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:986
msgid "``command delete`` - use ``command archive``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:987
msgid "``permissions show`` - use ``permissions role show``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:988
msgid "``mmctl user email`` - use ``mmctl user edit email``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:989
msgid "``mmctl user username`` - use ``mmctl user edit username``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:990
msgid ""
"Experimental certificate-based authentication feature has been removed. "
"``ExperimentalSettings.ClientSideCertEnable`` must be ``false`` to start "
"the server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:991
msgid ""
"Added logic to migrate the password hashing method from bcrypt to PBKDF2."
" The migration will happen progressively, migrating the password of a "
"user as soon as they enter it; e.g. when logging in or when double-"
"checking their password for any sensitive action. There is an edge case "
"where users might get locked out of their account: if a server upgrades "
"to v11 and user A logs in (i.e., they need to enter their password), and "
"then the server downgrades to v10.12 or previous, user A will no longer "
"be able to log in. In this case, admins will need to manually reset the "
"password of such users, through the system console or through the [mmctl "
"user reset-password [users]](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-"
"guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool.html#mmctl-user-reset-password) "
"command. The new password hashing method is more CPU-intensive. Admins of"
" servers with password-based login should monitor the performance on "
"periods where many users log in at the same time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:992
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``/api/v4/teams/{team_id}/channels/search_archived`` has been deprecated "
"in favour of ``/api/v4/channels/search`` with the deleted parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:993
msgid ""
"Changed default database connection pool settings: changed "
"``MaxOpenConns`` from 300 to 100 and ``MaxIdleConns`` from 20 to 50, "
"establishing a healthier 2:1 ratio for better database connection "
"management."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:994
msgid ""
"Separate notification log file has been deprecated. If admins want to "
"continue using a separate log file for notification logs, they can use "
"the ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` configuration. See the [Important Upgrade "
"Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/upgrade"
"/important-upgrade-notes.html) for an example configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:995
msgid ""
"Stopped supporting manually installed plugins as per "
"https://forum.mattermost.com/t/deprecation-notice-manual-plugin-"
"deployment/21192"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:996
msgid ""
"Support for PostgreSQL v13 has been removed. The new minimum PostgreSQL "
"version is v14+. See the [minimum supported PostgreSQL version "
"policy](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/software-hardware-"
"requirements.html#minimum-postgresql-database-support-policy) "
"documentation for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1004
msgid ""
"Under ``CloudSettings`` in ``config.json``, added "
"``PreviewModalBucketURL``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1005
msgid ""
"Removed ``VerboseDiagnostics`` configuration setting as part of removing "
"all telemetry support from Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1006
msgid "Removed ``BleveSettings`` configuration setting as part of removing Bleve."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1007
msgid ""
"Removed ``NotificationLogSettings`` as part of deprecating the separate "
"notification log file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1008
msgid "**Changes to Enterprise and Enterprise Advanced plans:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1009
msgid ""
"Removed ``ClientSideCertCheck`` as part of removing the experimental "
"certificate-based authentication feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1012
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v10.10, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-"
"guide/upgrade/important-upgrade-notes.html). In case of an upgrade "
"failure, please check the [Downgrade Guide](https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/administration-guide/upgrade/downgrading-mattermost-server.html) and the"
" [Recovery Guide](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/backup-"
"disaster-recovery.html) for rollback steps and interim mitigation "
"strategy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1017
msgid ""
"See [this blog post](https://mattermost.com/blog/mattermost-v11-powering-"
"more-mission-critical-collaboration/) on the highlights in our latest "
"release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1020
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged Agents plugin [v1.3.1](https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-agents/releases/tag/v1.3.1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1021
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged Boards plugin [v9.1.6](https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-boards/releases/tag/v9.1.6)."
