#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1022
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged MS Teams plugin [v2.2.2](https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-msteams/releases/tag/v2.2.2)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1023
