#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1024
msgid "Removed Playbooks v1 from pre-packaged plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1025
msgid "Updated the library used for customizing scrollbars."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1026
msgid ""
"Increased page size when retrieving posts in channels with high number of"
" hidden messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1029
msgid ""
"Introduced support for Mattermost Entry, a commercial evaluation "
"environment to explore Enterprise Advanced with usage limits. See more "
"details in [this forum "
"post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/mattermost-v11-changes-in-free-"
"offerings/25126)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1030
msgid ""
"User limits were lowered to final threshold of 250 for Mattermost Team "
"Edition (MIT-Compiled License)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1031
msgid ""
"Added support for a [FIPS-compliant Mattermost "
"image](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/server/deploy-"
"containers.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1032
msgid ""
"PBKDF2 is now used as the new key derivation algorithm for remote cluster"
" invitations. We do this in a backward compatible way such that "
"invitations generated from new/old clusters work in all clusters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1033
msgid ""
"Updated the default SAML signature algorithm from SHA1 to SHA256 for "
"improved security."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1034
msgid "Added admin-managed property fields to Custom Profile Attributes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1035
msgid ""
"Admin managed Custom Profile Attribute fields can now be used as part of "
"Attribute Based Access Control policies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1036
msgid ""
"System Admins can now mark Custom Profile Attribute fields as “admin "
"managed” from the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1037
msgid ""
"Added Channel-Level Attribute-Based Access Control (Available only in "
"Enterprise Advanced). Channel Admins can now configure attribute-based "
"access rules directly in Channel Settings through a new Access Control "
"tab when the ``EnableChannelScopeAccessControl`` setting is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1038
msgid "Channel access control policies now support multiple parent inheritances."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1039
msgid ""
"Updated interactive dialogs to use the apps form framework. Implemented "
"dynamic select and multi-select for interactive dialogs. Also, ``UserId``"
" and ``TeamId`` are now passed in interactive dialog submissions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1040
msgid ""
"Mattermost profile image is now deleted when LDAP profile picture is "
"deleted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1041
msgid "User ``auth_data`` is now shown in the System Console user details page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1042
msgid "Added Elasticsearch test to Support Packet diagnostics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1043
msgid "Added support for a new ``EmailNotificationWillBeSent`` plugin hook."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1044
msgid ""
"Added a console warning when a plugin uses the now-deprecated "
"``registerPostDropdownMenuComponent`` API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1046
msgid "mmctl"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1047
msgid "Added ``mmctl user edit`` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1048
msgid ""
"Updated mmctl shell completion to fully support zsh, powershell, and "
"fish. Check out ``mmctl completion`` for a guide on how to set it up for "
"your shell."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1049
msgid ""
"Added the ``mmctl cpa`` set of commands to manage Custom Profile "
"Attributes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.md:1052
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Benchmarking test results showed no significant difference: a 1.34% "
"decrease in the number of supported users for the new release, which lies"
" within the ``[-5%, +5%]`` prediction interval. View the full raw data "
"and methodology in our [Performance Reports "
"repository](https://github.com/mattermost/performance-reports/tree/main"
"/performance-comparisons/v11.0)."
